center gap-1 text-fg-secondary text-sm leading-6 w-fit pt-3 pb-0 focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-0 cursor-pointer group/canvas"><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span>Работало на протяжении 20s</span></span><span class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center" style="transform: rotate(-90deg);"><svg width="0.875rem" height="0.875rem" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><g id="name=chevron-down-md"><path id="vector" d="M19.4141 10L12 17.4141L4.58594 10L6 8.58594L12 14.5859L18 8.58594L19.4141 10Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g></svg></span></button></div><div aria-hidden="true"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="relative response-content-markdown markdown chat-md chat-md-links [&amp;&gt;:first-child:not(.not-prose)]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;:last-child:not(.not-prose)]:mb-0"><div class="streamdown-chat-md"><div class="sd:space-y-4 sd:whitespace-normal sd:[&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 sd:[&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0"><p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">How to make a repository public</strong></p>
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3 md:streamdown-first-block:mt-0 md:streamdown-last-block:mb-0">On GitHub (most common)</h3>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-fg-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Go to your repository on GitHub.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Click <strong class="font-semibold">Settings</strong> (top menu of the repo).</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">In the left sidebar, scroll down to <strong class="font-semibold">Danger Zone</strong>.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Click <strong class="font-semibold">Change visibility</strong>.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Select <strong class="font-semibold">Make public</strong>.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Type the repository name to confirm and click <strong class="font-semibold">I understand, change repository visibility</strong>.</li>
</ol>
<blockquote dir="auto" class="my-1 border-border-l3 [&amp;_p]:before:content-none [&amp;_p]:after:content-none streamdown-first-block:mt-0 streamdown-last-block:mb-0"><p dir="auto" class="break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Note: Once public, anyone can see the code. You cannot undo this without making it private again (and only if you have permission).</p></blockquote>
<hr class="border-border-l2 clear-both streamdown-first-block:mt-0 streamdown-last-block:mb-0">
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3 md:streamdown-first-block:mt-0 md:streamdown-last-block:mb-0">On GitLab</h3>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-fg-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Go to your project.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Click <strong class="font-semibold">Settings</strong> → <strong class="font-semibold">General</strong>.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Expand <strong class="font-semibold">Visibility, project features, permissions</strong>.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Change <strong class="font-semibold">Project visibility</strong> to <strong class="font-semibold">Public</strong>.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Click <strong class="font-semibold">Save changes</strong>.</li>
</ol>
<hr class="border-border-l2 clear-both streamdown-first-block:mt-0 streamdown-last-block:mb-0">
<h3 dir="auto" class="font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3 md:streamdown-first-block:mt-0 md:streamdown-last-block:mb-0">On Bitbucket</h3>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-fg-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Go to your repository.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Click <strong class="font-semibold">Repository settings</strong>.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Under <strong class="font-semibold">Repository details</strong>, change <strong class="font-semibold">Access level</strong> to <strong class="font-semibold">Public</strong>.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Click <strong class="font-semibold">Save</strong>.</li>
</ol>
<hr class="border-border-l2 clear-both streamdown-first-block:mt-0 streamdown-last-block:mb-0">
